WEBVTT

00:16.900 --> 00:20.350
<b><i>This isn't nearly enough men 
to guard an important general,</i></b>

00:20.350 --> 00:22.620
<b><i>but honestly, it's better 
for us that way.</i></b>

00:23.280 --> 00:27.880
<b>I want you to kill my best friend.</b>

00:30.070 --> 00:33.430
<b><i>Only my trusted aides know 
what's going on here.</i></b>

00:34.210 --> 00:36.930
<b><i>We have to keep witnesses to a minimum</i></b>

00:36.930 --> 00:39.840
<b><i>and make this look like 
an unfortunate accident.</i></b>

00:42.020 --> 00:45.980
<b>Imperial Capital Downtown</b>

00:46.190 --> 00:51.320
This story is a work of fiction. People, organizations, locations, laws, names, etc. have no relation to any real-life counterparts.

00:54.810 --> 00:56.370
<b>From west to east,</b>

00:56.890 --> 00:59.110
<b>and then back west...</b>

00:59.370 --> 01:03.120
<b>Even if it's an order, 
they're asking for a whole lot.</b>

01:04.010 --> 01:06.180
<b>You don't like being 
on an escort mission?</b>

01:06.530 --> 01:10.630
<b>"Escort"? I'm just sitting here 
until we get to the Federation.</b>

01:10.930 --> 01:15.750
<b>Aren't there more things I could be doing 
to help my comrades on the front lines?</b>

01:16.340 --> 01:18.950
<b>We should be attacking, not waiting 
for the enemy to show up!</b>

01:18.950 --> 01:20.760
<b>That's enough.</b>

01:21.390 --> 01:25.070
<b>We have our mission.</b>

01:26.600 --> 01:29.140
<b>You're sure it's not too soon?</b>

01:29.360 --> 01:32.580
<b>The bombers have just passed 
over the Empire's capital.</b>

01:32.580 --> 01:34.900
<b>There'll be more time before they arrive.</b>

01:34.900 --> 01:37.050
<b>We're welcoming our friends.</b>

01:37.050 --> 01:39.390
<b>Even if all we're doing
 is guarding and guiding them,</b>

01:39.390 --> 01:40.790
<b>we can't be late.</b>

01:41.460 --> 01:42.800
<b>And...</b>

01:42.800 --> 01:45.250
<b>You want me to have a chance 
to show this off, right?</b>

01:58.100 --> 01:59.030
<b>Enter.</b>

01:59.460 --> 02:00.510
<b>Excuse me.</b>

02:02.630 --> 02:04.010
<b>This is...</b>

02:04.010 --> 02:07.350
<b>General Rudersdorf asked me 
to give it to you before he left.</b>

02:22.830 --> 02:25.320
<b>General, are you unwell?</b>

02:25.690 --> 02:28.470
<b>No, I don't know what's wrong.</b>

02:28.950 --> 02:30.240
<b>But...</b>

02:34.510 --> 02:37.530
<b>Maybe it's a premonition of something.</b>

02:38.170 --> 02:42.180
<b>Episode Twelve
Exit</b>

02:51.170 --> 02:55.310
<b><i>This needs to be an accident 
caused by a maintenance failure.</i></b>

02:55.310 --> 02:58.740
<b><i>They can't be given a chance 
to use their parachutes.</i></b>

02:59.340 --> 03:02.440
<b><i>This can't be allowed to fail!</i></b>

03:07.150 --> 03:08.950
<b><i>Alert! Multiple contacts!</i></b>

03:09.820 --> 03:11.030
<b>12 o'clock!</b>

03:11.030 --> 03:12.860
<b>Enemy bombers!</b>

03:13.650 --> 03:15.050
<b>An enemy twin-engine?</b>

03:15.050 --> 03:18.470
<b>Looks like we ran into 
one of their patrols.</b>

03:18.470 --> 03:20.430
<b>We can't let them raise an alert.</b>

03:22.670 --> 03:23.730
<b>We'll take them down.</b>

03:29.260 --> 03:32.220
<b>Magical signatures detected 
from enemy bombers!</b>

03:32.220 --> 03:34.390
<b>Enemy mages? Here?</b>

03:34.820 --> 03:39.640
<b><i>As far as I know, there's no such thing 
as a convenient coincidence.</i></b>

03:39.640 --> 03:40.750
<b>Fuck.</b>

03:41.120 --> 03:44.410
<b>This is no chance encounter.</b>

03:44.410 --> 03:48.220
<b>Lieutenant Colonel, I can pretend to
provide a direct escort and then...</b>

03:48.220 --> 03:50.180
<b>No. It's too obvious.</b>

03:50.180 --> 03:51.240
<b>But...</b>

03:51.790 --> 03:54.260
<b>We have to assume other eyes 
will be looking this over.</b>

03:54.480 --> 03:56.930
<b>We need to provide a proper escort.</b>

03:57.460 --> 03:59.180
<b>We will support their retreat!</b>

03:59.180 --> 04:01.690
<b>Lt. Serebryakov, secure a retreat route!</b>

04:01.690 --> 04:05.000
<b>Grantz and Neumann, your units 
are to launch an assault!</b>

04:05.000 --> 04:06.630
<b>Everyone else, provide escort!</b>

04:15.410 --> 04:16.590
<b>Hang on!</b>

04:16.590 --> 04:17.630
<b>General!</b>

04:18.140 --> 04:19.890
<b>Wh-What's going on?</b>

04:25.110 --> 04:26.230
<b>It's the enemy!</b>

04:26.770 --> 04:29.470
<b>Our escorts are about to 
run into the enemy mages!</b>

04:29.470 --> 04:31.290
<b>Prepare for evasive maneuvers!</b>

04:34.770 --> 04:36.800
<b>It's strange.</b>

04:36.800 --> 04:40.580
<b>Why decide to have someone else do it?</b>

04:44.910 --> 04:46.320
<b>Visual on target!</b>

04:48.660 --> 04:50.370
<b><i>The Devil of the Rhine?</i></b>

04:50.370 --> 04:52.650
<b><i>Intelligence didn't say 
a damn word about that!</i></b>

04:53.270 --> 04:55.560
<b>I'll get her this time, for sure!</b>

04:58.360 --> 04:59.680
<b>Provide support for Lieutenant Sue!</b>

04:59.680 --> 05:00.660
<b>Hurry!</b>

05:00.660 --> 05:03.110
<b>Why? Why is this happening?</b>

05:03.960 --> 05:06.150
<b>Urgent message, Comrade Colonel.</b>

05:06.150 --> 05:10.550
<b>The Allied Kingdom bombers had an 
unexpected encounter with the enemy.</b>

05:10.990 --> 05:13.530
<b>And what did the party decide to do?</b>

05:13.770 --> 05:17.440
<b>Our orders are to bring 
the Allied Kingdom bombers in safely.</b>

05:17.440 --> 05:21.130
<b>If something happens, it could damage 
our international friendship.</b>

05:21.680 --> 05:23.170
<b>Understood.</b>

05:26.900 --> 05:27.970
<b>We're going out.</b>

05:33.310 --> 05:34.880
<b>Deploy shields!</b>

05:39.620 --> 05:41.450
<b>Don't let them get close 
to the transport!</b>

05:41.450 --> 05:42.700
<b>Buy time until it can escape...</b>

05:42.700 --> 05:43.730
<b>Dodge, Weiss!</b>

05:48.540 --> 05:49.950
<b><i>This attack...</i></b>

05:52.740 --> 05:54.610
<b><i>Her again?!</i></b>

05:58.310 --> 06:00.320
<b><i>So it is the enemy, then?</i></b>

06:00.320 --> 06:03.100
<b><i>I guess I was a little too suspicious.</i></b>

06:04.160 --> 06:05.720
<b><i>It's strange.</i></b>

06:05.720 --> 06:09.650
<b><i>The stronger the enemy seems 
to me, the better I feel.</i></b>

06:10.160 --> 06:14.510
<b><i>Even though it's me they're after, 
I don't feel upset at all.</i></b>

06:15.650 --> 06:17.290
<b>Salamander to Cargo!</b>

06:17.290 --> 06:19.340
<b>I want to get the package out of here!</b>

06:19.640 --> 06:22.340
<b><i>Shit! Why is she so damn persistent?!</i></b>

06:22.340 --> 06:25.980
<b><i>Even the infamous Degurechaff 
is complaining?</i></b>

06:25.980 --> 06:30.030
<b><i>I hope I get a chance to 
tell Zettour someday.</i></b>

06:35.000 --> 06:37.490
<b>Devil! Face the judgment of God!</b>

06:38.490 --> 06:39.700
<b>Major Weiss!</b>

06:39.700 --> 06:41.490
<b>You keep the transport safe!</b>

06:41.490 --> 06:43.020
<b>I'll draw her away!</b>

06:43.020 --> 06:44.180
<b>Lieutenant Colonel!</b>

06:44.660 --> 06:46.510
<b>Wait! I won't let you get away!</b>

06:52.120 --> 06:55.810
<b>If you really think 
you're one of God's angels,</b>

06:56.130 --> 06:58.210
<b>then I'll rip off your damn wings!</b>

06:59.280 --> 07:01.800
<b>We're almost in the combat zone!</b>

07:01.800 --> 07:02.970
<b>Wait.</b>

07:04.050 --> 07:04.980
<b>Is that...</b>

07:05.490 --> 07:07.150
<b>The Devil of the Rhine?</b>

07:07.510 --> 07:10.400
<b>And if the Devil of the Rhine is present,</b>

07:10.680 --> 07:13.110
<b>we are to shoot her down 
and secure her at all costs.</b>

07:13.640 --> 07:18.540
<b><i>The order I was given at Soldim 
remains the party's highest priority.</i></b>

07:19.180 --> 07:22.070
<b>Now that I've seen her, I have no choice.</b>

07:22.370 --> 07:25.960
<b><i>Allied Kingdom commanding officer, 
this is the Federation commanding officer.</i></b>

07:25.960 --> 07:26.880
<b><i>Do you copy?</i></b>

07:26.880 --> 07:28.400
<b>Colonel Mikel!</b>

07:28.400 --> 07:29.840
<b>You came!</b>

07:29.840 --> 07:32.000
<b>We'll take the Devil of the Rhine.</b>

07:32.000 --> 07:33.290
<b><i>You're sure?</i></b>

07:33.290 --> 07:36.150
<b>It's a host's job to 
 take care of his guests!</b>

07:38.830 --> 07:40.590
<b><i>Why did this happen?</i></b>

08:34.280 --> 08:38.040
<b>So you just gained altitude without 
thinking about what you were doing at all?</b>

08:38.040 --> 08:42.920
<b>I'm lucky that people who rely on 
their faith tend to stop thinking.</b>

08:43.680 --> 08:50.080
<b>But I hate the fact that I have to 
rely on this computation jewel.</b>

09:03.090 --> 09:06.620
<b>What? It's not her magical signature!</b>

09:08.540 --> 09:10.100
<b>A Federation mage?</b>

09:10.590 --> 09:11.940
<b>The one from before?</b>

09:21.810 --> 09:25.930
<b><i>That computation jewel 
is just leaking magic.</i></b>

09:25.930 --> 09:28.140
<b><i>No thought at all to safety...</i></b>

09:28.140 --> 09:30.680
<b><i>Everybody's got their own 
mad scientist, I guess.</i></b>

09:39.730 --> 09:41.960
<b><i>Damn it! I can't break through!</i></b>

09:41.960 --> 09:43.270
<b><i>What the hell's going on?</i></b>

09:43.270 --> 09:45.220
<b><i>None of this was in the plan!</i></b>

09:45.220 --> 09:46.220
<b><i>Then...</i></b>

09:51.600 --> 09:56.360
<b>I'm disappointed that someone of your 
skill would attempt the same trick twice.</b>

10:36.170 --> 10:38.750
<b>Forgive me, my friend.</b>

10:39.310 --> 10:43.690
<b>It's been so long since 
everything changed.</b>

10:49.210 --> 10:52.200
<b>Duty, necessity, friendship...</b>

10:52.670 --> 10:55.960
<b>What was the right answer?</b>

11:00.770 --> 11:05.190
<b>I always thought I hadn't changed, but...</b>

11:08.880 --> 11:12.110
<b>I was swept up in the flow, 
forced to choose...</b>

11:12.700 --> 11:16.600
<b>I tried to make our destruction happen 
in the best way it could...</b>

11:16.600 --> 11:18.860
<b>But how was any of that me?</b>

11:23.370 --> 11:27.410
<b>God... Go to hell.</b>

11:27.410 --> 11:31.020
<b>Give back my prayers. My hopes!</b>

11:34.760 --> 11:36.290
<b>Very well...</b>

11:36.680 --> 11:40.100
<b>I was always prepared to be a beast.</b>

11:40.530 --> 11:43.540
<b>I will gladly become a coward as well.</b>

11:46.810 --> 11:52.870
<b>As long as my nation's future and its 
history understand me, that's enough.</b>

11:52.870 --> 11:56.230
<b>It would be too much to 
ask for anything else.</b>

11:59.140 --> 12:01.820
<b>Damn the little traces of 
humanity I have left...</b>

12:01.820 --> 12:03.650
<b>A human being couldn't do this.</b>

12:12.920 --> 12:16.250
<b>Not even a strategy officer could.</b>

12:16.250 --> 12:19.390
<b>A beast of logic and necessity.</b>

12:31.940 --> 12:36.700
<b>A monster wearing 
the skin of a human, huh?</b>

12:45.210 --> 12:49.060
<b>Sometimes it's bad to be 
too good at your job.</b>

12:49.720 --> 12:51.740
<b><i>Was this what she was after?</i></b>

12:52.070 --> 12:54.440
<b>We're going down together.</b>

13:08.760 --> 13:11.680
<b>Lord, let your word be made manifest.</b>

13:11.680 --> 13:15.510
<b>May it become a bow that 
sharpens your believers like a sword!</b>

13:15.860 --> 13:18.850
<b>Oh, Lord, for I am your arrow!</b>

13:19.090 --> 13:23.050
<b>A lone arrow that you nock and fire!</b>

13:23.050 --> 13:27.610
<b>An arrow that pierces lies 
and brings victory!</b>

14:00.900 --> 14:03.550
<b>Our escort mages' defense line 
is on the verge of breaking!</b>

14:03.550 --> 14:05.570
<b>General! Your parachute!</b>

14:05.900 --> 14:07.760
<b><i>That's fine.</i></b>

14:07.760 --> 14:11.860
<b><i>I much prefer it when 
the enemy's trying to kill me.</i></b>

14:21.310 --> 14:23.600
<b>I-It's Lieutenant Degurechaff!</b>

14:23.600 --> 14:25.470
<b>She protected the transport!</b>

14:39.680 --> 14:44.000
<b><i>Yeah, I figured you'd aim for me.</i></b>

15:20.440 --> 15:23.700
<b><i>So I suspected my friend, 
and he was innocent...</i></b>

15:33.110 --> 15:37.240
<b><i>I... am ashamed.</i></b>

15:45.290 --> 15:48.820
<b><i>If someone else is willing 
to dirty their hands for me,</i></b>

15:48.820 --> 15:51.090
<b><i>all the better.</i></b>

16:16.370 --> 16:19.390
<b>Lieutenant Colonel, what is it?</b>

16:19.390 --> 16:21.200
<b>You're on an escort mission, yes?</b>

16:26.650 --> 16:28.200
<b>Oh...</b>

16:36.430 --> 16:39.840
<b>I see. Well done.</b>

16:57.260 --> 17:00.690
<b>Y-You're sure about this?</b>

17:12.460 --> 17:15.470
<b>October 14th, Unified Year 1927</b>

17:15.970 --> 17:18.970
<b>Outskirts of the Imperial Capital</b>

17:18.960 --> 17:21.540
<b>They arrived right on time?</b>

17:27.550 --> 17:28.870
<b>Where's the general?</b>

17:28.870 --> 17:30.610
<b>He...</b>

17:34.720 --> 17:38.860
<b>I just didn't feel like getting 
on a transport, you know.</b>

17:43.310 --> 17:45.840
<b>Good old Strategic HQ.</b>

17:46.290 --> 17:48.790
<b>Glad to be back, everyone.</b>

17:50.420 --> 17:53.270
<b>Now, get back to work.</b>

17:53.750 --> 17:56.030
<b>Not even a speech, huh?</b>

17:56.030 --> 17:57.870
<b>What do you expect?</b>

17:57.870 --> 18:00.290
<b>He lost a friend, after all.</b>

18:05.120 --> 18:10.810
<b><i>The only possible successor to 
General Rudersdorf was General Zettour.</i></b>

18:10.810 --> 18:13.570
<b><i>That was Strategic HQ's 
unanimous opinion.</i></b>

18:14.790 --> 18:17.980
<b><i>Thus he was relieved of 
his mission in the east</i></b>

18:17.980 --> 18:21.500
<b><i>and appointed Deputy Director
 of War Affairs and Strategy,</i></b>

18:21.500 --> 18:24.500
<b><i>an entirely unprecedented position.</i></b>

18:25.330 --> 18:28.140
<b><i>The government and bureaucrats 
complained about</i></b>

18:28.140 --> 18:31.570
<b><i>his now having more power than 
the Chief of the General Staff.</i></b>

18:31.570 --> 18:33.510
<b><i>But the military ignored them.</i></b>

18:34.590 --> 18:38.260
<b><i>The emperor himself was reluctant to 
approve this, but it didn't matter.</i></b>

18:38.260 --> 18:44.150
<b><i>Zettour supposedly said something to him 
while giving advice in a private room.</i></b>

18:45.020 --> 18:49.260
<b>Sheesh... my title's longer 
than I would like.</b>

18:49.260 --> 18:53.370
<b>But I suppose this fulfills my goal 
of taking complete control.</b>

18:53.370 --> 18:57.910
<b>Colonel Adelheid from the military police 
seems to be sniffing around.</b>

18:59.530 --> 19:03.520
<b>It's fine. I know him well.</b>

19:04.310 --> 19:05.800
<b>Will you attend the funeral?</b>

19:06.780 --> 19:08.490
<b>I have work to do.</b>

19:08.490 --> 19:12.280
<b>I can just apologize to him 
on the other side.</b>

19:12.700 --> 19:16.210
<b>Sir, do you mean...</b>

19:18.470 --> 19:22.660
<b>For the first time in my life, 
I'm grateful to the Allied Kingdom.</b>

19:23.530 --> 19:27.280
<b>I shouldn't say another word about it.</b>

19:38.230 --> 19:42.880
<b><i>The military band played a sad melody</i></b>

19:42.880 --> 19:48.160
<b><i>as General Kurt von Rudersdorf's 
funeral was held today.</i></b>

19:48.990 --> 19:53.410
<b><i>General Rudersdorf's coffin was 
loaded onto an artillery carriage,</i></b>

19:53.410 --> 19:58.240
<b><i>and is heading to the grounds as the 
people praise his bravery as a soldier.</i></b>

19:58.920 --> 20:02.960
<b><i>The carriage has just arrived,</i></b>

20:02.960 --> 20:07.370
<b><i>and as his family watches,</i></b>

20:07.370 --> 20:12.640
<b><i>he joins the many who have made 
the ultimate sacrifice...</i></b>

20:12.640 --> 20:17.900
<b>If we can end this war, I'll make a 
picture book out of what you just said.</b>

20:23.390 --> 20:25.030
<b><i>But...</i></b>

20:25.030 --> 20:28.540
<b><i>My hope to retire and live off 
royalties isn't dead yet.</i></b>

20:28.540 --> 20:31.550
<b><i>I didn't even end up 
having to kill my allies!</i></b>

20:31.550 --> 20:32.360
<b><i>I knew it!</i></b>

20:32.360 --> 20:36.530
<b><i>Only the modern mind and a strong, free 
will can open the path to the future!</i></b>

20:36.530 --> 20:39.550
<b>If I have to draw a book or two, I will!</b>

20:39.550 --> 20:41.540
<b>I don't need other people's help!</b>

20:41.540 --> 20:45.410
<b>If I do it with the power 
of my will, it's easy!</b>

20:52.880 --> 20:56.970
<b>Well? How do you like that, Being X?</b>

21:04.110 --> 21:07.780
<b>Well, whatever. The war will end now.</b>

21:07.780 --> 21:11.390
<b>I can finally be done with this shit.</b>

21:27.130 --> 21:29.180
<b>Has the Empire gone insane?</b>

21:29.180 --> 21:31.560
<b>They're really attacking us, too?</b>

21:31.560 --> 21:34.270
<b>Damn it! This is my home!</b>

21:38.670 --> 21:40.590
<b>Don't let them strengthen their lines!</b>

21:40.590 --> 21:42.570
<b>Knock down those Ildoan nests!</b>

21:42.570 --> 21:44.340
<b>What's going on?</b>

21:44.340 --> 21:46.240
<b>What the hell is going on?</b>

21:57.200 --> 21:59.200
<b>Why did this...</b>
